`far_snaps` are all explained: PHARMACY DRIVE-THRU (15.1 m) is drawn outside the building; PHARMACY (3.6 m), BAKERY (3.0 m) and DELI (2.7 m) sit inside sealed staff space and snap out to their customer frontage — the same pattern 659 has for SEAFOOD.

`walk_truth.json` locks it in with 19 `must` (entrance approach, both front alleys, each department's customer frontage, six distinct aisle corridors, the pharmacy pickup corridor) and 20 `must_not` (four page corners, parking/drive-thru/curbside, every sealed staff interior, both enclosed back rooms, the dispensary, a checkout-lane interior).

